{"id":"457d2f1becb8a815","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-min-operator.md","title":"Minimization Operator $\\mu$","display":"df-min-operator — Minimization Operator $\\mu$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-min-operator","aliases":["58-df-min-operator","58-df-mu-operator"],"display":"df-min-operator — Minimization Operator $\\mu$","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-min-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-min-operator</span><span>58-df-mu-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-min-operator — Minimization Operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3dd0e6836d447ca6\" href=\"?note=3dd0e6836d447ca6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\subseteq\\omega^{k+1}\\times\\omega\">\\(g\\subseteq\\omega^{k+1}\\times\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>；函数参数组使用有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle\">\\(\\vec x^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle\\)</span> 表示拼接。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S(f,g,k)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S(f,g,k)\\)</span> 为下式定义的图关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}(\\mu g)\">\\(\\operatorname{graph}(\\mu g)\\)</span> 保留原调用名称，其定义域为至少一元的有限元部分函数图。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> 是内部依赖中的集合部分函数谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S(f,g,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;k\\in\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,\\omega^{k+1},\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f=\\left\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:\n\\langle\\vec x^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle,0\\rangle\\in g\\land\n\\forall z\\in y\\;\\exists v\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\langle\\vec x^\\frown\\langle z\\rangle,v\\rangle\\in g\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S(f,g,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;k\\in\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,\\omega^{k+1},\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f=\\left\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:\n\\langle\\vec x^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle,0\\rangle\\in g\\land\n\\forall z\\in y\\;\\exists v\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\langle\\vec x^\\frown\\langle z\\rangle,v\\rangle\\in g\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}min\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{graph}(\\mu g)=f\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S(f,g,k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}min\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{graph}(\\mu g)=f\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S(f,g,k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在全函数输入上仍是原来的最小零点定义；对部分函数输入，所有较小参数必须先收敛到非零值。</li>\n<li>单参数算子显式存在量化元数；非空输入图确定唯一元数，空图在所有可用元数下均产生空输出图。闭包定义使用显式三元关系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"3dd0e6836d447ca6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"g\\subseteq\\omega^{k+1}\\times\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S(f,g,k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{graph}(\\mu g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S(f,g,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&k\\in\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,\\omega^{k+1},\\omega)\\\\\n&\\land f=\\left\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:\n\\langle\\vec x^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle,0\\rangle\\in g\\land\n\\forall z\\in y\\;\\exists v\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\langle\\vec x^\\frown\\langle z\\rangle,v\\rangle\\in g\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}min\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{graph}(\\mu g)=f\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S(f,g,k).","display":true}],"bytes":1721,"backlinks":[{"id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-min-operator.md]] — 最小化算子"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-846","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-min-operator.md|58-df-min-operator]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["5045d216c83e75cb","36d7463d215be751","3dd0e6836d447ca6"]}